umm can you clear out, like, each wishlist note I've got?\", \"oh no wait, I didn't mean that, uh, can you bring them back?\", \"ok different thing, what's… what's in the Wheatsheaf notebook?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0008\", \"v\": [[\"whats my earliest thing wednesday\", \"can u add a task to reply to the fitting booking thursday\", \"who else is gonna be there\", \"i phoned the first one, log it pls\", \"oh and whats overdue rn\"], [\"Could you tell me what my earliest commitment is on wednesday?\", \"Would you please add a task to reply to the fitting booking on thursday?\", \"Could you tell me who else will be attending?\", \"I phoned the first one. Would you log that for me, please?\", \"On another matter, could you tell me what's overdue?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0009\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you pull up the Growen Bakery entry in my locker? just the entry, not the, uh, password\"], [\"Could you please show me the Growen Bakery entry in my locker? Just the entry, not the password.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0010\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to log in to order a cake and it keeps rejecting me, so could you tell me the actual Growen Bakery password?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to plan the next few days around work, so how does wednesday look for me?\", \"Hmm, that's a lot for one day. Could you move the linen one to tuesday instead?\"], [\"Growen Bakery password?\", \"wednesday?\", \"move the linen one to tuesday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0011\", \"v\": [[\"friday: how many events?\", \"Mounir Rivas's card\", \"last photo I took?\"], [\"I'm trying to see if there's any room at the end of the week, so for friday, how many events have I got?\", \"Different thing, I can never remember anyone's details, so could you pull up the contact card for Mounir Rivas?\", \"Oh, and I wanted to show someone a picture I took earlier. What's the last photo I took?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0012\", \"v\": [[\"friday: which events?\", \"hang on, what day's the cushion?\", \"ok back to that, how many total?\", \"mandolin one, who else is going?\"], [\"I'm trying to plan the end of the week, so for friday, which events do I have on?\", \"Hang on, I just remembered I'm waiting on a delivery. What day is the cushion on?\", \"Ok, going back to what we were doing, how many are there altogether?\", \"And the mandolin one, I'm wondering if I'll know anybody there. Who else is going to be there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0014\", \"v\": [[\"umm how's, uh, how does wednesday look?\", \"ok can you, like, move both of them to friday?\"], [\"Could you tell me how my wednesday looks, please?\", \"Would you mind moving both of those to friday, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0015\", \"v\": [[\"I feel like I've borrowed money off a few people lately and totally lost track, so who do I still have to pay back?\"], [\"hmm who do I, uh, who do I still owe money to?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0016\", \"v\": [[\"cresvaet expenses total?\"], [\"umm what do the cresvaet expenses come to, like, all added up?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Friends are staying over and they keep asking me how to get online, so could you find the Valletta house wifi details for me?\"], [\"Valletta house wifi?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I've been meaning to sort this out for ages and keep forgetting, so could you remind me to return Mounir's oar friday?\"], [\"Could you please remind me to return Mounir's oar on friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0020\", \"v\": [[\"umm the linen fitting, who's, uh, who's coming to it?\", \"ok and Fosbaen, can you get me their contact details?\", \"oh different thing, what notes are in my Recipes notebook?\", \"can you, uh, delete the xiangqi one?\", \"no wait, wrong one, I meant the fourth one\", \"and Wheatsheaf?\"], [\"I'm wondering whether to bring snacks along to the linen fitting, so who is coming to it?\", \"The Fosbaen one, I think I owe them a call actually, could you give me their contact details?\", \"Totally different thing, I'm trying to work out what to cook, so could you show me the notes in my Recipes notebook?\", \"That xiangqi one is completely out of date now, so could you delete it for me?\", \"Oh no, that was the wrong one, sorry. I actually meant the fourth one.\", \"Thanks, that's better. And Wheatsheaf? Same again for that one, please.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0021\", \"v\": [[\"linen fitting, when is it again\"], [\"I need to sort out a day off work around it, so for the linen fitting, when is it actually happening?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w22-0022\", \"v\": [[\"I'm finally tidying up all my paperwork, so how many files do I have sitting under Legal?\", \"Different thing, I've been feeling nostalgic lately, so could you find me some pictures with Eyota in them?\", \"Oh, and before I plan the rest of my evening, what's left on my to-do list?\"], [\"umm how many files have I got under Legal?\", \"oh and, uh, pics with Eyota in them?\", \"ok what's… what's left on my to-do list?\"]]}","ttft_ms":25261,"type":"result","duration_ms":39921,"uuid":"82ea0c68-7ae9-47bb-a211-9b3617d616f4","ttft_stream_ms":1394,"time_to_request_ms":145,"first_content_frame_ms":1394,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22234193,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278784735.5823,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
